WEBVTT

00:15:28.749 --> 00:15:31.980
It is really hard to face the injustice
that exists in the world,

00:15:32.004 --> 00:15:36.034
while still believing in the ability
of people to really change.

00:15:36.591 --> 00:15:39.659
That takes an enormous amount
of faith and dedication.

00:15:40.058 --> 00:15:41.344
And beyond that,

00:15:41.368 --> 00:15:43.477
marriage is hard work.

00:15:43.501 --> 00:15:44.652
(Laughter)

00:15:44.676 --> 00:15:47.244
Piles of dirty socks on the floor,

00:15:47.268 --> 00:15:51.029
more boring sports shows
than I ever thought possible --

00:15:51.053 --> 00:15:52.308
(Laughter)

00:15:52.743 --> 00:15:54.487
And fights that bring me to tears

00:15:54.511 --> 00:15:57.376
when it feels like we're not
speaking the same language.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.519
But there is not a day that goes by

00:15:59.543 --> 00:16:02.776
where I am not so grateful
to be married to this man;